        "Aqua Regia is a 3:1 mixture of concentrated Hydrochloric Acid (HCl) and concentrated Nitric Acid (HNO3) used to dissolve noble metals like Gold and Platinum.",
        "Galvanisation is a method of protecting steel and iron from rusting by coating them with a thin layer of Zinc.",
        "Graphite is an allotrope of carbon that conducts electricity, making it an exceptional non-metal conductor.",
